# Client brand copies (multi-brand) — a client's brain and brand settings
# live in Render Secret Files, never in this public repo. Only The Glam
# Shelf's (already public) files and the fake example brand are tracked;
# `git add` refuses anything else in brands/ or brain/ without -f.
brands/*
!brands/glamshelf.json
!brands/example.json
brain/*
!brain/brain.md
!brain/history/
*.brain.md
*.brand.json
/brain.md
/brand.json
